msgid "GraalVM/Mandrel upgrade"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 2.14.1.Final with some bugfixes and documentation "
"improvements on top of our 2.14.0.Final release."
msgstr ""

msgid "It is a recommended upgrade for anyone already using 2.14."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using 2.14, please refer to https://github.com/"
"quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-2.14[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We don't usually upgrade GraalVM/Mandrel in a micro release but GraalVM/"
"Mandrel 22.3 is a LTS release and we decided to move to it early, rather "
"than wait for Quarkus 2.15."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We don't think it will cause problems for applications but you might have to "
"adjust your extensions if you make use of GraalVM substitutions.\n"
"Make sure to have a look at https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/"
"Migration-Guide-2.14[our migration guide] if it is the case."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Also, GraalVM/Mandrel 22.2 is now the minimal version to use to build native "
"executables."
msgstr ""

msgid "Mandrel by default"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For in-container builds, Quarkus now uses Mandrel by default to build native "
"executables."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/2.14.1."
"Final[the full changelog of 2.14.1.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
